WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:26.257 --> 00:00:28.460
 We were once mankind.


00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.298
 We were humanity.


00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:41.806
 And now...


00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.576
 We're no more than pests.


00:00:45.543 --> 00:00:47.846
 Vermin.


00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:50.050
 They came here
to exterminate us.


00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:57.356
 They took our history
and culture.


00:00:57.356 --> 00:01:01.561
 They covered our landworks
in dying humanity.


00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:04.096
 The wail of the dying
carried for miles.


00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.701
 They're building
some kind of breeding facility


00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.403
 for those that survive.


00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:14.606
 People that have defected
say it's worse than Hell,


00:01:14.606 --> 00:01:17.310
 humans becoming some kind
of surrogate incubators


00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.379
 for the alien young.


00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:28.221
 They killed us in waves
when they first arrived.


00:01:30.822 --> 00:01:35.026
They built these megastructures
that spew methane,


00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:37.697
manufacturing their atmosphere.


00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.301
 They've sown their crops,


00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:43.936
 snuffing out
our plant life,


00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:46.473
raising the global temperature,
causing our cities to flood.


00:01:49.808 --> 00:01:51.878
 They waged war on Earth.


00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:55.046
 They set fire to our forests.


00:01:55.046 --> 00:01:57.616
It's already hard to breathe...


00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:00.686
 impossible to breathe
if you are close to the stacks.


00:02:03.421 --> 00:02:05.524
 Rats...


00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:07.760
 insects...


00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.296
 humans...


00:02:11.296 --> 00:02:13.231
 they hack into our psyche,


00:02:13.231 --> 00:02:14.667
 into our minds,


00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.534
 paralyzing us,


00:02:16.534 --> 00:02:21.306
 taking control of the cerebrum
and the limbic system,


00:02:21.306 --> 00:02:24.376
 rendering us slaves.


00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:27.213
 We've been able
to design a brain barrier


00:02:27.212 --> 00:02:30.415
 that protects us
from their influence.


00:02:30.415 --> 00:02:34.219
 They know we can't produce
enough of these for everyone,


00:02:34.219 --> 00:02:35.722
that it's just a matter of time


00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:39.925
 before the entire planet
is theirs...


00:02:39.925 --> 00:02:41.493
 but we're survivors.


00:02:46.298 --> 00:02:47.734
 Scrounging enough to eat...


00:02:50.602 --> 00:02:52.872
 gathering enough morale
to fight.


00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:10.421
 I wonder if deep down,


00:03:10.421 --> 00:03:13.992
 each person knows
we're already dead.


00:03:13.992 --> 00:03:16.762
 I wonder if only one, sick,
primordial instinct


00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:20.165
 keeps marching us forward
aimlessly.


00:03:20.165 --> 00:03:22.634
 Every rational thought
tells us it's over.


00:03:26.705 --> 00:03:29.408
 Every vile,
deceptive, chemical emotion


00:03:29.408 --> 00:03:31.477
 tells us it isn't.


00:03:37.082 --> 00:03:40.853
 We are sold a different story
by our politicians.


00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:16.254
Come with us!


00:04:16.254 --> 00:04:19.557
Do not be afraid!


00:04:19.557 --> 00:04:20.892
They want what's best for us!


00:04:20.892 --> 00:04:22.561
Come on.


00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:29.935
They have built
a conservatory for us!


00:04:29.935 --> 00:04:32.872
Paradise!


00:04:32.872 --> 00:04:34.973
Put down your guns!


00:04:34.973 --> 00:04:36.741
There it is.


00:04:36.742 --> 00:04:41.112
Come on, freaky-faced fuck.
Come on.


00:04:41.112 --> 00:04:42.714
Come with us!


00:04:42.714 --> 00:04:45.584
Do not be afraid!


00:04:45.584 --> 00:04:51.456
They have built a conservatory!


00:04:51.456 --> 00:04:53.860
Come with us, friends!


00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.294
Come on, come on, come on.


00:04:55.293 --> 00:04:57.195
...paradise!


00:04:57.196 --> 00:04:59.598
I'll go
to the new conservatory.


00:04:59.598 --> 00:05:03.068
Take me with you, please.


00:05:03.067 --> 00:05:04.569
There it is. There it is.


00:05:33.966 --> 00:05:37.603
 Every once in a while,
something goes our way.


00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:40.072
 Just one in a thousand.


00:05:40.072 --> 00:05:41.740
 Just enough to keep fighting.


00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:45.545
 A glimmer of hope.


00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.949
 People will pay for this.


00:05:53.451 --> 00:05:55.053
 They always do.


00:06:03.728 --> 00:06:05.063
 Even for small victories,


00:06:05.064 --> 00:06:09.235
 it would seem that everything
was lost.


00:06:09.235 --> 00:06:13.004
 Humanity would soon
cease to exist.


00:06:35.927 --> 00:06:39.130
 Until they arrived,


00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:43.869
like angels carried on the rays
of the Aurora Borealis.


00:06:54.579 --> 00:06:57.115
 Like a biblical salvation.


00:07:16.502 --> 00:07:19.371
The new world altered everyone.


00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.108
 Adapt or die, it was
as simple as that.


00:07:25.944 --> 00:07:28.781
 In the old world, Nosh would
have been locked up.


00:07:28.781 --> 00:07:32.451
 A pyromaniac, a bomb-maker...


00:07:32.451 --> 00:07:36.121
but here, he not only survived,
he thrived.


00:08:01.413 --> 00:08:05.250
 Nosh could make just about
anything out of scavenged junk.


00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:13.225
Bombs, brain locks... anything.


00:08:13.225 --> 00:08:14.894
 We needed him, and he knew it.


00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:17.461
How many you got?


00:08:17.461 --> 00:08:19.731
Uh, four.


00:08:19.732 --> 00:08:21.166
No.


00:08:21.165 --> 00:08:22.567
We need more than that.


00:08:22.567 --> 00:08:23.935
Sure, yeah.


00:08:23.935 --> 00:08:25.137
And payment?


00:08:25.137 --> 00:08:26.971
You can do the usual?


00:08:26.971 --> 00:08:28.039
Yeah, yeah, sure.


00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.908
What about the...


00:08:29.908 --> 00:08:31.143
the item?


00:08:31.142 --> 00:08:33.011
We've heard about it.


00:08:35.447 --> 00:08:36.982
Yeah, um...


00:08:38.383 --> 00:08:39.317
It's not for sale.


00:08:39.317 --> 00:08:41.153
You piece of shit.


00:08:42.721 --> 00:08:43.822
You don't fuckin'...


00:08:43.822 --> 00:08:44.556
Wait.


00:08:44.556 --> 00:08:46.559
My friend...


00:08:46.558 --> 00:08:48.793
we need your help.
You know that.


00:08:48.793 --> 00:08:49.761
Yeah.


00:08:49.761 --> 00:08:50.996
Everything has a price,


00:08:50.996 --> 00:08:52.330
and we can pay you.


00:08:52.331 --> 00:08:53.199
Sure.


00:08:53.198 --> 00:08:55.099
Hmm.


00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.969
Hey, Jasper.


00:08:56.969 --> 00:08:59.004
I'm glad these fucking things
came here.


00:08:59.004 --> 00:09:01.440
They mean that I get to burn
whatever I see.


00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.574
Every day.


00:09:02.573 --> 00:09:03.474
Every night.


00:09:03.475 --> 00:09:04.375
No laws.


00:09:04.375 --> 00:09:06.278
No fucking jails.


00:09:06.278 --> 00:09:08.080
The fire...


00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.014
The fire.


00:09:09.014 --> 00:09:11.483
What is it with you
and the fucking fire?


00:09:11.482 --> 00:09:12.851
Fire!!!


00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.289
I'll die and perish
in the fire someday.


00:09:18.289 --> 00:09:19.123
You say
you need my help?


00:09:19.124 --> 00:09:20.359
For what?


00:09:20.359 --> 00:09:23.128
For a fucking hope for things
to go back to the way they were?


00:09:24.596 --> 00:09:26.432
Just give me...
gimme some bait.


00:09:26.432 --> 00:09:27.566
Some bait?


00:09:27.566 --> 00:09:28.399
I just need
some bait,


00:09:28.399 --> 00:09:29.367
some of your people...


00:09:29.368 --> 00:09:30.569
some of your people,


00:09:30.568 --> 00:09:32.003
some of the sick you don't need.


00:09:33.138 --> 00:09:34.006
I'm two seconds away


00:09:34.005 --> 00:09:36.040
from blowing this
motherfucker's head off.


00:09:36.041 --> 00:09:38.511
Oh, it would be so good.
So much fun.


00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.245
Just a little more!


00:09:40.245 --> 00:09:41.112
Gimme some bait.


00:09:41.113 --> 00:09:42.314
Gimme some bait.


00:09:42.313 --> 00:09:43.882
It'll make
the "boom" bigger.


00:09:43.883 --> 00:09:45.150
I'll take out
an entire convoy.


00:09:45.149 --> 00:09:47.185
That'll help you, right?


00:09:47.186 --> 00:09:49.956
I have enough ordnance
to make this fire breathe.


00:09:50.956 --> 00:09:53.893
You're an interesting person,
Nosh.


00:09:55.126 --> 00:09:56.928
Have fun in the fire.


00:09:56.928 --> 00:09:59.365
Oh, I will.


00:10:00.599 --> 00:10:05.070
 Some sick people in exchange
for Nosh's item.


00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:08.373
 In peacetime, such an offer
would be insane.


00:10:08.373 --> 00:10:09.708
 Immoral.


00:10:09.707 --> 00:10:13.846
But now... anything's possible.


00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.748
Ma'am, we've done
everything we can.


00:10:16.748 --> 00:10:18.217
 He's not responding.


00:10:23.254 --> 00:10:24.990
All right. Let's go.


00:10:28.961 --> 00:10:32.230
 We picked up Amir
in Sector 7.


00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.700
 At first,
they thought he was dead,


00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.302
 some refuse
from one of their experiments.


00:10:41.405 --> 00:10:42.974
Amir?


00:10:44.909 --> 00:10:46.211
Amir?


00:10:50.349 --> 00:10:52.985
Amir... Hey.


00:10:54.653 --> 00:10:56.187
I'm not going
to hurt you.


00:10:59.691 --> 00:11:00.759
Look at me.


00:11:00.759 --> 00:11:03.360
You can help us.


00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.362
Kill him.


00:11:04.363 --> 00:11:06.097
Just fucking kill him.


00:11:06.096 --> 00:11:07.732
All that shit
they put in his head.


00:11:07.732 --> 00:11:09.100
-He's not even one of us--
-Stop.


00:11:16.274 --> 00:11:18.709
I'm not going to hurt you.


00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:19.912
I know what they did.


00:11:27.485 --> 00:11:29.821
It's okay.


00:11:29.821 --> 00:11:31.389
Let's get this off.


00:11:39.096 --> 00:11:41.165
There.


00:11:41.166 --> 00:11:42.268
You're free.


00:11:43.969 --> 00:11:45.271
We've gotta check
the wounded, ma'am.


00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.738
Okay.


00:11:59.118 --> 00:12:00.453
It's okay.


00:12:11.629 --> 00:12:12.764
I'm Sarah.


00:12:14.532 --> 00:12:17.403
I need to ask you
for a favor.


00:12:17.403 --> 00:12:20.172
I give you food,


00:12:20.172 --> 00:12:23.075
you do me a favor.


00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.278
Okay?


00:12:52.136 --> 00:12:54.506
It's okay, it's okay.
It's fine.


00:12:56.240 --> 00:13:00.379
I need to see
what it did to you.


00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.783
It's okay.


00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:32.177
 This world
had changed all of us...


00:13:33.977 --> 00:13:35.548
 but Amir had been reborn...


00:13:37.682 --> 00:13:39.552
 with something entirely new.


00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:21.259
You see all these men?


00:14:22.894 --> 00:14:24.529
They're going out to fight.


00:14:25.797 --> 00:14:29.067
To try to make it
how it was before.


00:14:29.067 --> 00:14:33.072
To stop those beasts
from doing more of this...


00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:39.644
What is it
with her


00:14:39.644 --> 00:14:40.913
and that
fucking thing?


00:14:43.414 --> 00:14:45.350
Her daughter is gone.


00:14:47.184 --> 00:14:48.920
Everyone's daughter
is gone.


00:14:51.221 --> 00:14:53.891
The ones
that are experimented on,


00:14:53.892 --> 00:14:56.695
who survive...


00:14:56.695 --> 00:14:58.964
the very few...


00:14:58.964 --> 00:15:00.232
Her theory is


00:15:00.231 --> 00:15:04.001
it's because they have
some kind of predisposition.


00:15:04.001 --> 00:15:06.404
They're savants of some kind.


00:15:07.438 --> 00:15:09.341
And Amir is like that.


00:15:10.708 --> 00:15:12.209
These men are trying
to stop the genocide.


00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:16.181
Alpha team! Move out!


00:15:20.384 --> 00:15:22.922
They're ready
to sacrifice themselves.


00:15:24.188 --> 00:15:25.123
Let's go!


00:15:27.793 --> 00:15:29.561
They don't have to die tonight.


00:15:31.163 --> 00:15:32.163
Help us.


00:15:32.163 --> 00:15:33.764
Please.


00:15:33.764 --> 00:15:35.366
Tell me
what futures you see.


00:15:38.535 --> 00:15:39.603
Turn to the left.


00:15:39.604 --> 00:15:41.674
Incoming!


00:15:56.855 --> 00:16:00.359
You can help us
turn the tide, Amir.


00:16:00.359 --> 00:16:02.393
We can beat them.


00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:10.402
Threat down
in Fox Squadron.


00:16:10.402 --> 00:16:11.270
Threat down.


00:16:14.205 --> 00:16:16.475
All right, everyone,
triple-check those brain locks.


00:16:18.744 --> 00:16:20.144
I don't want anyone
looking at it,


00:16:20.144 --> 00:16:22.581
and keep out of
its line of sight, right?


00:16:36.094 --> 00:16:37.629
What do you see?


00:16:39.831 --> 00:16:41.667
Do you see us
winning, Amir?


00:16:43.735 --> 00:16:45.704
Go! Go! Go!


00:16:50.341 --> 00:16:52.211
Can we learn to hunt them?


00:16:54.645 --> 00:16:56.748
 Can we make them fear us?


00:16:58.582 --> 00:17:00.052
Go! Go!


00:17:04.955 --> 00:17:07.125
Amir...


00:17:09.094 --> 00:17:11.196
 Do you remember
what they did to you?


00:17:12.396 --> 00:17:15.033
 They do experiments
all day and all night.


00:17:18.068 --> 00:17:19.738
 They tear people apart.


00:17:22.907 --> 00:17:24.007
It's wounded!


00:17:24.008 --> 00:17:25.843
That fucking thing!
Don't let it get away!


00:17:29.747 --> 00:17:31.784
Billions die...


00:17:34.486 --> 00:17:35.621
 No one lives.


00:17:35.621 --> 00:17:37.389
 Not through that.


00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.599
But every once in a while,
a miracle happens.


00:17:49.866 --> 00:17:52.471
One in ten million, like you.


00:17:54.405 --> 00:17:57.608
Someone who somehow survives...


00:17:59.544 --> 00:18:01.113
 Their cruelty.


00:18:06.183 --> 00:18:08.485
 Those things have given you
an amazing power.


00:18:08.486 --> 00:18:09.655
 A gift.


00:18:11.623 --> 00:18:12.657
 Beyond man.


00:18:12.656 --> 00:18:13.858
Don't look at it!


00:18:13.858 --> 00:18:14.925
Look away!


00:18:14.925 --> 00:18:17.628
 You can do the things they do.


00:18:32.376 --> 00:18:34.445
Put it down, Martinez!
Put it down!


00:18:40.352 --> 00:18:41.719
Don't do it,
Martinez!


00:18:41.719 --> 00:18:42.886
Don't do it!


00:19:09.713 --> 00:19:11.849
 Amir...


00:19:11.849 --> 00:19:13.251
 Please tell me...


00:19:15.385 --> 00:19:17.822
 What futures do you see?


00:19:32.403 --> 00:19:35.406
Cut its fucking head off.


00:19:49.587 --> 00:19:51.189
Amir, it's tine.


00:19:51.189 --> 00:19:52.824
You have to use
what they gave you.


00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.831
 It's not a choice.

